---
const faqs = [
  ['Who are you?', 'A small design studio led by a UX designer with over 3 years of experience designing websites and apps. We are new as a studio, which is why our price is low and our examples are concept projects.'],
  ['How can it be this fast?', 'We do one kind of website and we do it every day. We also use modern AI tools for the building work, so the designer\'s time goes into the design.'],
  ['What if I don\'t like it?', 'You see the full design before you pay the second half, and 2 rounds of changes are included.'],
  ['How do I pay?', 'We send an invoice. Half before we start, half when you approve the finished site.'],
  ['Who looks after the site later?', 'You do. We hand over everything with a short video showing how to change text and photos. Most owners never need more than that.'],
  ['Where are you based?', 'We are based in India and work online with business owners in other countries. Everything happens by email and video call.'],
];
---
<section class="section" id="questions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="label">Questions</span>
      <h2 class="h2" data-reveal>Fair things to ask.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      {faqs.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{q}</summary>
          <p>{a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
